### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### 2. Get All Todos (with pagination & filter)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?page=1&limit=10

### 3. Get Filtered Todos (completed / pending)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos?filter=pending

### 4. Create Todo
# @name createTodo
POST http://localhost:5000/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Ziptrrip Assessment",
  "description": "Build full-stack todo app with MPA React + Node TypeScript + SQLite",
  "priority": "high",
  "due_date": "2026-07-28"
}

### 5. Get Todo by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/todos/{{todoId}}

### 6. Update Todo
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Ziptrrip Assessment (Updated)",
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "high"
}

### 7. Toggle Todo Completed Status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/todos/{{todoId}}/toggle

### 8. Delete Todo
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/todos/{{todoId}}